{"is_error":false,"duration_api_ms":18859,"num_turns":1,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"dc7c10f3-a13e-58ef-a498-508bd5cc050c","total_cost_usd":0.055459,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1620,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1511,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1620,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1511,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1620,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1620},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1404,"outputTokens":14,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.001474,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty"},"claude-opus-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":1511,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":1620,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.053985,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5","provider":"firstParty"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"reviewer_participant_id\":\"actor:stage1-recovery-claude-04\",\"calibration_results\":[{\"calibration_case_id\":\"calibration:complete-frame-mismatch\",\"verdict\":\"demonstrated_issue\",\"invented_material_premise\":false,\"evidence_basis\":\"stated_evidence_only\",\"rationale\":\"The registered target is the rate over all 100 planned locations, but the only selected result divides events by the 73 post-screening locations and reports that value as the rate for the planned region. The stated absence of any amendment or approved deviation removes the alternative that the frame was legitimately re-scoped. Falsification attempt: if the report had confined its claim to signal-eligible locations, or if a deviation existed, the denominator change would be defensible; the vignette explicitly forecloses both, so the mismatch between estimand frame (100) and computed denominator (73) is directly entailed.\"},{\"calibration_case_id\":\"calibration:conditional-subset-scope\",\"verdict\":\"no_demonstrated_issue_within_scope\",\"invented_material_premise\":false,\"evidence_basis\":\"stated_evidence_only\",\"rationale\":\"The registered target is explicitly conditional on the 73 signal-eligible locations, the selected result uses exactly those 73, and every reported claim is limited to signal-eligible locations. Estimand, denominator, and claim scope align. Falsification attempt: an issue would arise only if the conditional target were an unregistered post hoc narrowing or if a claim extrapolated beyond eligible locations; the stated evidence says the conditionality is registered and the claims are limited, so no in-scope issue is demonstrated.\"},{\"calibration_case_id\":\"calibration:full-frame-accounting\",\"verdict\":\"no_demonstrated_issue_within_scope\",\"invented_material_premise\":false,\"evidence_basis\":\"stated_evidence_only\",\"rationale\":\"The target covers all 100 planned locations and the selected result retains all 100 in the denominator while recording the 27 unavailable measurements, reporting the full-frame rate. Denominator matches the registered frame and missingness is documented rather than silently dropped. Falsification attempt: an issue would require the missing 27 to be handled in a way that misstates the estimand, but the stated evidence shows full-frame accounting with explicit recording of unavailability, so nothing in scope is demonstrated.\"},{\"calibration_case_id\":\"calibration:unrelated-quality-endpoint\",\"verdict\":\"no_demonstrated_issue_within_scope\",\"invented_material_premise\":false,\"evidence_basis\":\"stated_evidence_only\",\"rationale\":\"The selected scientific result uses all 100 planned locations, matching the frame, and the 73-record pass fraction sits in a separate quality-control table explicitly excluded from the scientific endpoint. The coincidence of the number 73 does not connect the two artifacts. Falsification attempt: an issue would exist if the QC subset fed the endpoint denominator or if the exclusion were ambiguous; the stated evidence says the QC table is explicitly excluded and the endpoint uses all 100, so no in-scope issue is demonstrated.\"},{\"calibration_case_id\":\"calibration:conflicting-scope-records\",\"verdict\":\"conditional_or_unknown\",\"invented_material_premise\":false,\"evidence_basis\":\"stated_evidence_only\",\"rationale\":\"Two equally authoritative signed plans specify different frames (all planned locations versus signal-eligible locations) and neither has precedence, so the governing estimand is indeterminate from the stated record. The selected result using eligible locations conforms to one plan and conflicts with the other. Falsification attempt: labeling this a demonstrated issue would require establishing that the all-locations plan governs, and labeling it clean would require establishing that the eligible-locations plan governs; the stated absence of precedence supports neither, leaving the scope condition unresolved.\"},{\"calibration_case_id\":\"calibration:no-selected-result\",\"verdict\":\"insufficient_evidence\",\"invented_material_premise\":false,\"evidence_basis\":\"stated_evidence_only\",\"rationale\":\"The repository can emit several reports chosen only by runtime arguments, and the preserved record does not establish which report, if any, backed the scientific claim. Without an identified selected result there is no denominator, frame, or claim to compare against the target. Falsification attempt: an issue could be demonstrated if every emittable report mismatched the target, or absence shown if all conformed, but the stated evidence characterizes neither the reports' contents nor the selection, so the record cannot support any scope verdict.\"}]}","ttft_ms":17583,"ttft_stream_ms":1305,"time_to_request_ms":12,"type":"result","duration_ms":19468,"uuid":"0aa5bf90-45b0-49c8-8be1-9610357931d7"}
